  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Upon uploading a new avatar currently with the new menu, there is no way to get it to refresh your uploaded avatar list to show newly uploaded avatars. If you are updating an old avatar there is no issue but when creating a new avatar id, it won't appear in your ingame uploaded list until a game restart. My suggestion would be to have a button to force an update to check for a new model upload. or do so on world reload. or even, every few min to avoid this annoyance of needing for a game restart.",
